WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.812
- Congratulations on your
Golden Globe nomination.

00:00:01.812 --> 00:00:02.645
- [Ben] Thank you very much.

00:00:02.645 --> 00:00:03.478
- That's so cool.

00:00:03.478 --> 00:00:04.757
(audience applauding)

00:00:04.757 --> 00:00:09.540
I have to say Snoop announcing
it was my favorite part.

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.521
I want you to see it unless you missed it.

00:00:12.521 --> 00:00:14.231
- [Ben] That was nice, yeah.

00:00:14.231 --> 00:00:16.287
- Ben Affleck.

00:00:16.287 --> 00:00:17.728
Ben Affleck, my fault.

00:00:17.728 --> 00:00:20.230
(audience laughing quietly)

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:21.460
Sorry about that, Ben.

00:00:22.728 --> 00:00:26.117
- (laughing) He got the
emphasis a little off.

00:00:26.117 --> 00:00:26.950
It was a little...

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:28.250
- He did get the emphasis
a little off, yeah.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.810
It's funny, because I always
grew up and I thought,

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:33.150
Affleck, what an incredibly ugly name.

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:35.303
Now, it sounds like the duck commercial.

00:00:35.303 --> 00:00:36.163
- Affleck.

00:00:36.163 --> 00:00:37.060
- Affleck.

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:38.400
- Yes, I know, isn't that funny?

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.703
- Yes, you're the first person to say it.

00:00:41.703 --> 00:00:45.000
- When I was a kid, my parents,
I always remember them,

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.820
the old days when people would call you up

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:48.870
for a magazine subscription or something,

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:51.860
and they'd go, "A, F as
in Frank, F as in Frank."

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:54.260
And I was always like, why
do they always do that?

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:56.040
And I realized, as I started
looking through the mail,

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:57.420
we would get, and it would always be like,

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:59.630
Mr. And Mrs. A-S-S-L-I-C-K.

00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:00.910
And I was like, I see.

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:02.070
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:03.655
- [Ben] You hate to
have that misunderstood.

00:01:03.655 --> 00:01:04.488
- You hate it.

00:01:04.488 --> 00:01:05.321
You hate to see it.

00:01:05.321 --> 00:01:07.660
Love that you didn't say
it on daytime TV, 'cause...

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:09.464
- Spelled it out, because
people can't read.

00:01:09.464 --> 00:01:10.797
- [Kelly] Yeah, read it aloud to yourself.

